  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Among my good resolutions for the New Year I very nearly included the determination never to be punctual again.",
      "output_sha256": "110459d5151cfe691be030be6eeea93cca8cb68393312f3c512d1838d9931e53",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "110459d5151cfe691be030be6eeea93cca8cb68393312f3c512d1838d9931e53",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Just in time, I reconsidered this impulsive notion, but it was a close call.",
      "output_sha256": "12806854df25c5609a2de475e8158d912c4da487c80cceaad5ff2e9b014f9309",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.473593,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7bf3f657e5e21c80b399024fb14105c95c4b7a23122cb770994244b3bb466905"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "12806854df25c5609a2de475e8158d912c4da487c80cceaad5ff2e9b014f9309",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For quite some time, I had prided myself on being punctual.",
      "output_sha256": "0226ec2ae7a5842e8ebbfad4cb9ce5bb1814067ce0f89045251185dd4084dc88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.328914,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "88175fbe3cfc67919e9710194469fc02dcc4a0a0a4be277afed2fd6fe8d272a2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0226ec2ae7a5842e8ebbfad4cb9ce5bb1814067ce0f89045251185dd4084dc88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This commitment had, perhaps, led to a certain self-righteousness on my part, as I was often critical of those who took a more relaxed approach to timeliness.",
      "output_sha256": "856b37cd5074af7cdf6955e9e2f6aee00402bd2a50449b14d42ef1231c28b37b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.328914,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "88175fbe3cfc67919e9710194469fc02dcc4a0a0a4be277afed2fd6fe8d272a2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "856b37cd5074af7cdf6955e9e2f6aee00402bd2a50449b14d42ef1231c28b37b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But towards the close of 1919 doubts began to creep in.",
      "output_sha256": "217e2a6444a1f3557040b81852f4bf69c1e50f65ecec22cd8e3430247de7a0b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "217e2a6444a1f3557040b81852f4bf69c1e50f65ecec22cd8e3430247de7a0b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For one thing, modern conditions were making it very hard to keep engagements to the letter; taxis were scarce and trains and omnibuses crowded, so that in order to be punctual one had to walk and thus lose many precious minutes; for another, I had such a number of appointments which were not kept by the other parties that I had to take the matter into serious consideration, for they all meant disorganisation of a rather exacting time-table at a period when I was unusually busy.",
      "output_sha256": "d667868532c827d3656134e15f8f3f477337d112f10b745ec343540ecb1ab227",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "d667868532c827d3656134e15f8f3f477337d112f10b745ec343540ecb1ab227",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Additionally, I found that waiting for someone who was late left me feeling restless and unable to focus on anything else.",
      "output_sha256": "69c099fab40cefd0c31513a9b0c5501de3bc9305abdf82e42795bc18fd6b40c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.33631,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d129bcee4d0a5f0aad6cb20778e72dea2c6315919f9ad5b56ea713debeb39c0f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69c099fab40cefd0c31513a9b0c5501de3bc9305abdf82e42795bc18fd6b40c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why, I began to ask myself, should I do all the waiting and get hungry and cross, and why should they do all the arriving-when-everything-is-ready?",
      "output_sha256": "4715dc8138de4199f329acda5e752a3a040a9e15bd4580f1dfe2534c658df64f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "4715dc8138de4199f329acda5e752a3a040a9e15bd4580f1dfe2534c658df64f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Shouldn’t the roles be reversed?",
      "output_sha256": "024a9eefae5454410cf56cf4c65d84b9cee43aad608a8937f6a81c9d223a1e05",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.417857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f2b123498da123090dec5b4c427030619a64a39d043b1a151f4e7082dd4cf53a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "024a9eefae5454410cf56cf4c65d84b9cee43aad608a8937f6a81c9d223a1e05",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When conscription came in and martial habits became the rule, I had hoped and believed that punctuality was really likely to be established.",
      "output_sha256": "9c894b00049f83110bd800bb2fee93b05dffb12688e254a2a8da3bc172123956",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c894b00049f83110bd800bb2fee93b05dffb12688e254a2a8da3bc172123956",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I thought this because one had always heard so much about Army precision, and also because my most punctual friend for many years had been a soldier and we had engaged in a rivalry in the matter.",
      "output_sha256": "bd7a11ae7e0f8b830917693e7e697f66250c9ed80a18784963fd9a2b9e153152",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "bd7a11ae7e0f8b830917693e7e697f66250c9ed80a18784963fd9a2b9e153152",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I was wrong.",
      "output_sha256": "2f6955114688938f71dbf37ae446fa516b562c0f567962ae579be48869af37d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f6955114688938f71dbf37ae446fa516b562c0f567962ae579be48869af37d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "During the War the soldiers home on leave took every advantage of one's gratitude to them, while the first demobilised one whom I entertained kept me waiting forty minutes for dinner.",
      "output_sha256": "c628b7bce3144888f32954d93b823036c74ecb7b023c5c00240a981212b1f3c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "c628b7bce3144888f32954d93b823036c74ecb7b023c5c00240a981212b1f3c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The pity of it is that this particular tarrying guest is a man of eminence and capacity.",
      "output_sha256": "abb2826a2b7c3cf526118b2e72c02a7db4eab422f7e9e13034597661f67cc48a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "abb2826a2b7c3cf526118b2e72c02a7db4eab422f7e9e13034597661f67cc48a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Were he a failure, as according to our own Samuel Smiles or the author of that famous American book \"From Princeton College to Colonel House,\" he ought to be, all would be well; but he is not; he has never been punctual in his life and he has had an exceptionally successful career.",
      "output_sha256": "4bdb0abba4d18ca32f7dd312471aef1dbfeb297c22032e34e45547a225b25098",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "4bdb0abba4d18ca32f7dd312471aef1dbfeb297c22032e34e45547a225b25098",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Conventional wisdom suggests that unpunctual individuals are disqualified from achieving success; that their unreliability renders them untrustworthy and unemployable.",
      "output_sha256": "6fdb213740e51606a3627a8d432c86c73cb6faf7b4f21e58b16baa7504938cea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.251154,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9ed22f1adf4643d2dedc6f2080f36f211a74663cb35a034881ca5e530dfc2bf2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6fdb213740e51606a3627a8d432c86c73cb6faf7b4f21e58b16baa7504938cea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Supposedly, the ability to keep appointments reflects one's character and capabilities.",
      "output_sha256": "c99bfde752e649300fd053018b4b704dc55cc0f55809357a5809d3392558f3ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.331282,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "592d16bac6a074d9dba9c1bc19b99e474321400d54d1179603327bdeeda56e2f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c99bfde752e649300fd053018b4b704dc55cc0f55809357a5809d3392558f3ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is said that business professionals will dismiss candidates who do not arrive on time, regardless of their qualifications.",
      "output_sha256": "8f8f50045efc7e9088bcbab4e1a5dfcb2dd9afef5e58041eda29542423d18865",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.30836,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "694175a37a15a9bbe1eb2e2e96d819232328ff8ce6e04ffd02e5c8534a23f7d1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8f8f50045efc7e9088bcbab4e1a5dfcb2dd9afef5e58041eda29542423d18865",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But these hard and fast schemes of appraisement can, as I have shown, be all wrong.",
      "output_sha256": "03d6957d4bd94035ec727dffb300a4ddc930457ccefdea6f34c16feab3bcca23",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "03d6957d4bd94035ec727dffb300a4ddc930457ccefdea6f34c16feab3bcca23",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Wisdom, after all, is an element in business success; and what wise man would ever be punctual at his dentist's?",
      "output_sha256": "e4ade8d440a1d13720e56c7a14d353b0070457e5b29fd53dffe572c51b93d21e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4ade8d440a1d13720e56c7a14d353b0070457e5b29fd53dffe572c51b93d21e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What kind of respect a dentist has for his first appointment of the day, I cannot tell.",
      "output_sha256": "424aba0082f6b531f91341f47f67ef382fd2262a303bb40fe252278348699bbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "424aba0082f6b531f91341f47f67ef382fd2262a303bb40fe252278348699bbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have avoided these early séances; but every one knows that he is never ready for a patient at the covenanted hour after that.",
      "output_sha256": "235adc8dc24a78bbc8fe69a64ae30a2de2512a4685060c79395b6a9ad8003808",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "235adc8dc24a78bbc8fe69a64ae30a2de2512a4685060c79395b6a9ad8003808",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Editors tend to keep visitors waiting, and theatrical managers are notorious for their lack of punctuality; in their world, time seems to hold little significance.",
      "output_sha256": "072b877671974529cd197c1f8b896d4441e8f616b7a23cfc729437d87a9c10da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.345136,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "80822efa0d6140d7fa5beb6f24c70060f8b40f68c54bfdedc55f08cf33bdaf1b",
        "acf612684c45fc0edff26244312a3ab830596a3501c35c99a08b8c24f4deb062"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "072b877671974529cd197c1f8b896d4441e8f616b7a23cfc729437d87a9c10da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Rehearsals are one immense distracting outrage upon the routine of an ordered existence; and yet actors are a very happy folk.",
      "output_sha256": "71bbf2bf0da2564a5dc523cebccac363ad0b6ef212a9b52290f7757f623b3fca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "71bbf2bf0da2564a5dc523cebccac363ad0b6ef212a9b52290f7757f623b3fca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Until late in 1919, as I have said, I had loved Punctualia with a true ardour; but I now found myself sufficiently free from passion to be able to examine her critically and to discern faults.",
      "output_sha256": "f629e208dd0c81074fe6cfb275dbeb29780be6057de6d5e0629732d9a3575bfd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "f629e208dd0c81074fe6cfb275dbeb29780be6057de6d5e0629732d9a3575bfd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For there is a good deal to be said against her.",
      "output_sha256": "85df330bece25d16d39c9dd810c23aa2d8dfb64afacae562c5f3a275690dc318",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "85df330bece25d16d39c9dd810c23aa2d8dfb64afacae562c5f3a275690dc318",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To be always correct is a dangerous thing.",
      "output_sha256": "28b145e7757b7d88610d05b049144a18db0caff785facb31e14d3d0c54862664",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "28b145e7757b7d88610d05b049144a18db0caff785facb31e14d3d0c54862664",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have noticed that the people who are late are often so much jollier than the people who have to wait for them.",
      "output_sha256": "0881c92ef296a0e8fe6dafe8c3b6f56b1520f0387562aefaf3d2012c7f24c2c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "0881c92ef296a0e8fe6dafe8c3b6f56b1520f0387562aefaf3d2012c7f24c2c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Looking deeply into the matter, I realised that Punctualia, for all her complacency and air of rectitude, has lost a great many lives.",
      "output_sha256": "b4af00e5258d3349adf250aaa9bd44460d53fed747ba4744d4e8e8e146c079b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4af00e5258d3349adf250aaa9bd44460d53fed747ba4744d4e8e8e146c079b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The logic is straightforward: if you miss a train, you lose the opportunity to board it; and if you are not on that train and it meets with disaster, you continue to live, only to miss future chances.",
      "output_sha256": "12c367c4486fedbdbbb80c65b06973a02b4bf189c80650f484e81b93463468ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.504605,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30,
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "11ece6cfe6eea50e5f5288731577655e44235a7af2b42688151ca55570c39a73",
        "ece6e4a590079fef5790ee69d5d78c99d895eb1a57166013b4e74857c51aefd4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "12c367c4486fedbdbbb80c65b06973a02b4bf189c80650f484e81b93463468ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I recalled a significant incident within my own family that illustrated this point.",
      "output_sha256": "441d855cd3268626af75aab5079dd303689438900cd4b9524a987a27fe64913d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.444762,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bf6ae0bb3b408495cdddc800863b6ea67fcfff03ce25a427c4a13e1af1890a8e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "441d855cd3268626af75aab5079dd303689438900cd4b9524a987a27fe64913d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A relation of mine, with her daughter, had arranged to spend a holiday in the Channel Islands.",
      "output_sha256": "a8d1aaab8563eb764f0831ffb819e22d378ae46163a28de65a01bd21f4195355",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "a8d1aaab8563eb764f0831ffb819e22d378ae46163a28de65a01bd21f4195355",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A cabman promised and failed, arriving in time only to whip his horse all the way across London and miss the train by a minute.",
      "output_sha256": "d7a1d2c15c0b9ed07099b53c50583cfdc86a31d7e669a35d5e49f1159ec6cdd5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7a1d2c15c0b9ed07099b53c50583cfdc86a31d7e669a35d5e49f1159ec6cdd5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When, the next day, it was learned that the Channel Islands boat had struck the Casquettes and had gone down the ladies were so excited by their escape that they sought the cabman and by way of gratitude adopted one of his numerous children.",
      "output_sha256": "a10fe64d79e7a987e8b55bc828dc1310a4dfdfc0ea9c02158d37fe5c12dce163",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "a10fe64d79e7a987e8b55bc828dc1310a4dfdfc0ea9c02158d37fe5c12dce163",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This true story serves as a poignant testament to the potential hazards of punctuality.",
      "output_sha256": "0ad916da87a372e1121fc0a6f5fec084b4bc3e9eba50e90bc4717e804de284e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.323692,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c4449fba72727405f2ef66487b92354fe546f36f7fdfd92589cb1beeda1d6028"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0ad916da87a372e1121fc0a6f5fec084b4bc3e9eba50e90bc4717e804de284e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Had they caught that train, they would have perished, and the cab driver’s child would have grown up with far less opportunity.",
      "output_sha256": "a6db04a375ed524dc58c0617ae369f19a900cf973a345001590c82b638448239",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.471843,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "244daf1404a3e3e799d7ed42a354f60ba8b368b6b441a10a3a84526f09bf874f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6db04a375ed524dc58c0617ae369f19a900cf973a345001590c82b638448239",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Can you wonder, then, that I nearly included a determination never to be punctual again among my New Year resolutions?",
      "output_sha256": "6d809f612fa5ffb99b0304477d1227273d27f94005c8c4839083bcdb85d41d9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d809f612fa5ffb99b0304477d1227273d27f94005c8c4839083bcdb85d41d9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I did not go so far.",
      "output_sha256": "62cac1cad8e744faf96ca778fb03cfb9140c4359155962366418230eab986e0c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "62cac1cad8e744faf96ca778fb03cfb9140c4359155962366418230eab986e0c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I left it at the decision not to be so particular about punctuality as I used to be.",
      "output_sha256": "c66df5ee0bf3c865013151cc7546b5e09d9e9df5fb419dd44d314418a2509dd2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
